    "title": "Anjali Patil and Sailesh Rathnakumar's Tamil film Selvi wins two awards at Busan International Film Festival | Hindustan Times",
    "text": "Selvi wins two prizes at Busan Film Festival\nSelvi's win at Busan comes as part of the festival’s Vision section, which showcases films from across Asia. Each award carries a cash prize of KRW 10 million (around ₹7 lakh). Directed by Sailesh Rathnakumar, the film opened to a packed theatre at its world premiere last week, with its subsequent screenings also selling out.",
